policy settings, and compliance obligations.

Detection is not perfect. The Software can miss sensitive data or flag harmless
data. It is not a de-identification control. Skilak does not guarantee that it
identifies or redacts all Protected Health Information or other regulated data.
Skilak is not a HIPAA compliance certification provider, is not a Business
Associate, and does not sign Business Associate Agreements.

